00:19:54.810 --> 00:19:56.330
You'll find this part interesting.

00:19:56.730 --> 00:19:59.610
The 13th victim's head was found shoved in a birdcage.

00:20:00.030 --> 00:20:02.770
It seemed as though the Jake bird in that cage was also killed,

00:20:03.080 --> 00:20:04.660
but it miraculously survived.

00:20:04.980 --> 00:20:06.960
So are you saying the bird you have in that cage

00:20:06.960 --> 00:20:08.920
once belonged to the 13th victim?

00:20:09.240 --> 00:20:09.940
That's right.

00:20:10.180 --> 00:20:12.860
All right, Kay, let Jake bird out of its cage now.

00:20:46.260 --> 00:20:47.040
Go, bro.

00:20:47.580 --> 00:20:48.820
Go, bro.

00:21:04.280 --> 00:21:21.040
Did you just shoot that cop dead?

00:21:21.280 --> 00:21:22.160
He's just unconscious.

00:21:23.660 --> 00:21:24.140
Checkmate.

00:21:28.440 --> 00:21:29.800
So the other killer was arrested.

00:21:30.000 --> 00:21:33.550
That's correct. We learned that it was his twin brother.

00:21:33.830 --> 00:21:35.680
We can all rest easy now.

00:21:36.320 --> 00:21:38.700
Interesting that you used a Jake Bird to catch him.

00:21:38.820 --> 00:21:41.700
Well, we kind of figured with all the media coverage on this story,

00:21:41.900 --> 00:21:44.780
the chances of the killer posing as a salesman were pretty slim.

00:21:45.570 --> 00:21:47.750
The clue was that the murders were still continuing.

00:21:48.170 --> 00:21:52.080
Yeah. Plus, posing as a detective would make it much easier for the killer.

00:21:52.400 --> 00:21:54.300
We took a bit of a gamble and it paid off,

00:21:54.500 --> 00:21:57.180
but dumping that sugar on his head was no easy task.

00:21:57.800 --> 00:21:59.920
It's all thanks to that Jake Bird and his sweet-

00:22:01.650 --> 00:22:05.360
A murder game using beautiful women as chess pieces.

00:22:05.620 --> 00:22:07.000
What's the world coming to?

00:22:07.200 --> 00:22:09.510
Sorrow, love, even loneliness.

00:22:10.250 --> 00:22:12.490
People kill for a variety of selfish reasons.

00:22:13.560 --> 00:22:14.800
It's so foolish.

00:24:03.130 --> 00:24:03.950
Hope you've been well.

00:24:04.490 --> 00:24:05.030
Have fans?

00:24:06.220 --> 00:24:07.120
Do all the K-fans.

00:24:07.300 --> 00:24:08.640
Hope you've been good boys.

00:24:08.940 --> 00:24:09.240
What?

00:24:10.140 --> 00:24:11.020
Be me, chubby.

00:24:11.260 --> 00:24:12.360
Whatever, flatty.

00:24:12.420 --> 00:24:14.160
I dare you to say that again.

00:24:14.530 --> 00:24:14.830
Okay.

00:24:15.520 --> 00:24:15.880
Episode.

00:24:17.490 --> 00:24:19.710
The boy in the manor is a Terminator.

00:24:20.380 --> 00:24:21.480
Send us fan letters.

00:24:21.780 --> 00:24:22.540
We'll be waiting.

00:24:23.180 --> 00:24:24.080
Only to me, okay?

00:24:24.320 --> 00:24:25.130
No, me.
